</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sound Producer</i><br>Trumpetguy<br><br><i>Sound Editor</i><br>Rebecca Mondry-Zanaglio<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5018720/extras/095d6ad9ac9b1ae58f6fecca86586f70.avif?t=1788310638\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5018720/extras_big/095d6ad9ac9b1ae58f6fecca86586f70.webp?t=1788310638 width=1560 height=403 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WARNING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains depictions of violence, murder, and toxic relationship dynamics. Player discretion is advised.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5018720/extras/d9c5233e1c25e2b1719523a4f00f48b2.avif?t=1788310638\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5018720/extras_big/d9c5233e1c25e2b1719523a4f00f48b2.webp?t=1788310638 width=1560 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for taking the time to play LaurEli.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoyed the game, we would greatly appreciate a tip or feedback. Your support and kind words help us continue improving the game and bringing the story to life.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5018720/extras/d9c5233e1c25e2b1719523a4f00f48b2.avif?t=1788310638\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5018720/extras_big/d9c5233e1c25e2b1719523a4f00f48b2.webp?t=1788310638 width=1560 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the team that brought you <i>Oto-hime...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After an accident that left her using a wheelchair, detective Laura Le Fanu relocates to her uncle’s castle-like estate in rural Rhode Island. There she meets his maids and the mysterious butler Eli, who quickly forms a bond with her. When a maid is found dead and a storm traps them inside, Laura must unravel the truth—unaware that a vampire walks among them.<br><br>To explore the estate, investigate suspicious events, question characters, and present the right evidence to challenge contradictions in their statements. Your choices and deductions will shape the investigation and uncover the truth behind the murder. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHARACTERS</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5018720/extras/c0b8b4a748e70affcb3cc6a5728e2d90.avif?t=1788310638\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5018720/extras_big/c0b8b4a748e70affcb3cc6a5728e2d90.avif?t=1788310638 width=1560 height=610 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5018720/extras/4741ed212256278da9bb12ca0b20f4b6.avif?t=1788310638\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5018720/extras_big/4741ed212256278da9bb12ca0b20f4b6.avif?t=1788310638 width=1560 height=610 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5018720/extras/b16889c216c307742a81d92f6a4a6773.avif?t=1788310638\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5018720/extras_big/b16889c216c307742a81d92f6a4a6773.avif?t=1788310638 width=1560 height=610 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5018720/extras/d09a843e4a4dc4ab7c4f3fc294989038.avif?t=1788310638\" 